'''September Gauntlet''' (9月強襲！, ''9 Gatsu Kyōshū ！'', '''September Assault!''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that only appears during September and was added in the [[Version 10.8 Update]]. It features enemies from the [[Old Guys About Town (Monthly Event)|Old Guys About Town]] event.

==Overview==
===About===
The September Gauntlet contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] stages, called '''About Town Lvs''' (老神 Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of an About Town Lv can include [[Battle Items]], one Platinum Fragment and [[Ototo Corps|Catamins]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[September Gauntlet/About Town Lv.1~10]].''

==Play Requirements==
*September Gauntlet is unlocked after clearing [[Old Guys About Town (Monthly Event)|Old Guys About Town]].

